---
import '../../../../public/styles/global.css'
---

<section  class="py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-12 bg-[#262424] relative z-10">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
    
    <!-- Main Heading -->
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-white leading-tight">
        WHY PICKLEBALL NEEDS <span class="text-lime-400">SMART<br>SOLUTIONS</span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Three Column Content -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      
      <!-- Column 1: Growing Popularity -->
      <div class="text-left">
        <h3 class="text-lime-400 text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Growing Popularity</h3>
        <div class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p>
            Pickleball has exploded in popularity, becoming America's fastest-growing sport. With this growth comes an increasing demand for professional-grade training tools and equipment that can keep up with players' evolving needs.
          </p>
          <p>
            Traditional training methods often fall short, requiring constant ball collection, subjective line calls, and limited drill variety.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 2: Common Challenges -->
      <div class="text-left">
        <h3 class="text-lime-400 text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Common Challenges</h3>
        <div class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p>
            The pain points are clear: manual ball collection interrupts training flow, disputed line calls disrupt games, and inconsistent ball feeds limit skill development.
          </p>
          <p>
            Players waste valuable court time on maintenance tasks instead of focusing on improvement. Coaches struggle to provide consistent, high-quality training experiences for multiple skill levels simultaneously.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 3: Smart Solutions -->
      <div class="text-left">
        <h3 class="text-lime-400 text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Smart Solutions</h3>
        <div class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p>
            Tennibot's AI-powered gear tackles key training challenges with precision. The ball machine offers programmable feeds tailored to skill level, the robotic collector cleans up without stopping play, and the AI referee ensures accurate, unbiased calls.
          </p>
          <p>
            Designed for players and coaches alike, Tennibot helps you train more effectively and focus on performance.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>